WEBVTT

00:03.200 --> 00:09.080
Early in the 20th year of Yuankang Zu Kun broke through Beiyu Pass afterward with the Wuzhao at the Hanshui line.

00:09.160 --> 00:10.560
In a long stalemate.

00:11.320 --> 00:16.920
In June of the 23rd year of Yuankang Zu Kun again petitioned for the northern expedition the emperor did not approve.

00:17.000 --> 00:20.080
Ordered him to withdraw and return to court rise, rise.

00:20.200 --> 00:25.160
Yet the northern people knelt to keep the royal army volunteer armies also responded.

00:26.280 --> 00:30.800
That September Zu Kun captured Zhongzhou causing great shock in the court.

00:31.000 --> 00:35.360
Defeat would harm the state Your Majesty this war really cannot continue.

00:36.000 --> 00:40.640
The court issued eight imperial edicts ordering Zu Kun not to advance further.

00:40.720 --> 00:45.307
While cutting off his supplies secretly ordered Chen Ying and others to withdraw.

00:46.000 --> 00:51.320
October Chen Ying crossed south over Tianhe occupied the ferry behind Zu Kun.

00:52.600 --> 00:56.600
Zu Kun knew to press on to take Yong'an was hopeless.

00:57.000 --> 01:02.520
Years of war's accumulated ills coupled with inner frustration illness struck like a mountain General.

01:02.600 --> 01:07.800
Soon soon passed away at Beiyu Pass General.

01:33.400 --> 01:34.760
My father told me.

01:35.680 --> 01:38.013
He lived in Yong'an as a youth.

01:39.040 --> 01:41.040
Always thought Yong'an wasn't special.

01:42.000 --> 01:44.400
Those scholars' Ba willow trees.

01:45.120 --> 01:48.320
Yong'an flowers were just ordinary.

01:54.040 --> 01:55.440
All these years.

01:56.120 --> 01:59.640
I never thought my father cared much about that hometown.

02:00.760 --> 02:02.160
Doing all this.

02:03.200 --> 02:08.760
Was just for advancement for reputation for those tens of thousands of.

02:08.840 --> 02:10.440
Hungry mouths under him.

02:16.280 --> 02:19.120
But this time taking Beiyu Pass.

02:21.120 --> 02:22.520
I realized.

02:23.400 --> 02:25.000
He actually cared so much.

02:31.400 --> 02:32.800
He stood right here.

02:33.680 --> 02:36.520
He told me standing this high.

02:37.600 --> 02:39.800
Why still can't see Yong'an?

02:41.840 --> 02:44.173
Raising my eyes, I see the sun.

02:45.120 --> 02:46.520
But not Yong'an.

02:51.280 --> 02:54.240
Maybe when people get old they always miss home.

02:58.280 --> 03:02.560
Your Highness in the palace, honored and precious servants like clouds.

03:02.840 --> 03:08.840
Pushing for the northern expedition do you truly care about these northern lives or to win hearts.

03:10.440 --> 03:12.360
To gain leverage in the succession?

